  titleEn: Portrait of Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj
  panelEn: "Chhatrapati Shivaji Maharaj (1630\u20131680) founded Hindavi Swarajya, the Maratha kingdom of the Deccan, and was crowned at Raigad in 1674. This gallery follows his life through the arms, coins, forts and ships of his era. (Replica portrait.)"
